=== A. BIMOND static reduction (Milgrom 2009), derived from L = -[b(grad f)^2 + a(grad fh)^2 - a0^2 M(|grad f*|^2/a0^2)]/8piG - rho f - rho_t fh, f* = f - fh
  [PASS] A1 s g* = a g_N - b g_Nt: residual 0
  [PASS] A2 L g = g_N + g_Nt + a g*: residual 0
  [PASS] A3 L ghat = g_N + g_Nt - b g*: residual 0
  [PASS] A4 exact law needs s = a^2 g/a0: residual 0
  [PASS] A5 alpha cancels: S(h) = h/(a0-h), h = g - g_N: residual 0
  [PASS] A6 h -> a0 as g -> oo (tail) and h -> g as g -> 0: limits
  twin force at L = 1: ghat = g_N - (b/a) h for a baryon source; repulsive when (b/a) h > g_N

=== B. BIMOND scalar Y on two metrics: lapse velocities (FRW and static)
  FRW Y = 3*(A**3*Ah*N*Nh**2*vAh*vNh - A**3*Ah*Nh**3*vAh*vN - A**3*N*Nh**3*vAh**2 + 3*A**2*Ah*N*Nh**3*vA*vAh - A*Ah**3*N**3*vAh*vNh + A*Ah**3*N**2*Nh*vAh*vN - A*Ah**2*N**3*Nh*vAh**2 - 2*A*Ah**2*N*Nh**3*vA**2 + Ah**3*N**3*Nh*vA*vAh)/(A**3*Ah**2*N**3*Nh**3)
  dY/d(Ndot) = -3*vAh*(A*Nh - Ah*N)*(A*Nh + Ah*N)/(A**2*Ah*N**3*Nh**2)
  [PASS] B1 Ndot enters Y linearly on FRW, nonzero off proportional cones: so nonlinear M gives Ndot a kinetic term through M''
  [PASS] B2 dY/dNdot vanishes on equal cones: bracket 1/N^2 - Ah^2/(A^2 Nh^2)
  static weak-field Y = -2 |grad f*|^2
