  Hessian eig (a, ah, N, Nh velocities), M'<0 M''<0: [-5.7454, -4.4384, -1.7125e-16, 0.19922]
  Hessian eig (a, ah, N, Nh velocities), M'<0 M''>0: [-5.2113, -8.4173e-17, 0.19816, 3.6297]
  Y at this FRW point = -0.087; static side has sign of -2
  velocity Hessian rank: M'' = 0 -> 3, M'' != 0 -> 3
  [FAIL] B3 nonlinear M raises the velocity rank (lapse constraint lost in the homogeneous sector): 3 -> 3

