=== G. K3: galileon scaling cannot give the deep law
  [PASS] G1 M^(1/2) needs n = 3, then r exponent is -1/2, not -1: n [3], exponent -1/2
  [PASS] G2 no n gives M^(1/2)/r: over-determined

=== H. K5: a second field completing gamma_L
  [PASS] H1 positive-norm sigma reduces the stiffness at every k: - k^4/(e k^2 + 1/gam)
  [PASS] H2 the gamma_L sign (+ gam k^4 at small k) is the negative-norm sigma: needs sigma^2 with the wrong sign

